      "category": "billing_and_payments",
      "proposedBody": "Hello Gordon Gekko,\n\nThank you for reaching out to Brilliant Directories Support.\n\nRegarding your inquiry about \"Inquiry regarding volume discount for 20 directory websites\":\n\nYou can manage membership tiers in Finance > Membership Plans. From here you can configure pricing, renewal frequencies (monthly/annual), and profile publishing privileges.\n\nFor detailed documentation and step-by-step guidance, please review the official Solution Center guide:\n• Finance: Membership Plans Management: https://support.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000078901-membership-plans\n\nIf you need any further assistance configuring your directory, please let us know.\n\nBest regards,\nBrilliant Directories Technical Support\nBrilliant Directories Support & Technical Consulting",
      "supportingSources": [
        {
          "title": "Finance: Membership Plans Management",
          "url": "https://support.brilliantdirectories.com/support/solutions/articles/12000078901-membership-plans",
          "snippet": "Navigate to Finance > Membership Plans to create, edit, or clone member pricing tiers.",
          "score": 0.85,
